Now fix makeBuilding gx/gz double-count bug. Current code:

```js
  const gx = (cx * CHUNK_CELLS + bx) * CELL + px;
  const gz = (cy * CHUNK_CELLS + by) * CELL + pz;
```

bx is absolute block index; px is absolute world x already (lotOx + offset). Fix to `gx = px; gz = pz;`.

